      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_operations(s1: str, s2: str, s3: str) -> int:\n    # Find the length of the longest common prefix\n    L = 0\n    for c1, c2, c3 in zip(s1, s2, s3):\n        if c1 == c2 == c3:\n            L += 1\n        else:\n            break\n    \n    # If there is no common prefix, it's impossible to make them equal\n    if L == 0:\n        return -1\n    \n    # Total operations = (len(s1) - L) + (len(s2) - L) + (len(s3) - L)\n    return len(s1) + len(s2) + len(s3) - 3 * L\n```",
