      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef buyChoco(prices: List[int], money: int) -> int:\n    # Find the two smallest prices\n    min1 = float('inf')  # smallest\n    min2 = float('inf')  # second smallest\n    for p in prices:\n        if p < min1:\n            min2 = min1\n            min1 = p\n        elif p < min2:\n            min2 = p\n    total = min1 + min2\n    # If the total cost is affordable, return leftover; otherwise return original money\n    return money - total if total <= money else money\n```",
