      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\nMOD = 10**9 + 7\n\ndef solve(n: int, sick: List[int]) -> int:\n    # Precompute factorials and inverse factorials up to n\n    fact = [1] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        fact[i] = fact[i - 1] * i % MOD\n\n    inv_fact = [1] * (n + 1)\n    inv_fact[n] = pow(fact[n], MOD - 2, MOD)\n    for i in range(n, 0, -1):\n        inv_fact[i - 1] = inv_fact[i] * i % MOD\n\n    # Precompute powers of 2 up to n\n    pow2 = [1] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        pow2[i] = pow2[i - 1] * 2 % MOD\n\n    # Determine intervals of healthy children\n    intervals = []\n    # Left interval\n    intervals.append(sick[0] - 0)\n    # Middle intervals\n    for i in range(len(sick) - 1):\n        intervals.append(sick[i + 1] - sick[i] - 1)\n    # Right interval\n    intervals.append((n - 1) - sick[-1])\n\n    total = sum(intervals)\n    ans = fact[total]\n    for size in intervals:\n        ans = ans * inv_fact[size] % MOD\n\n    # Multiply by 2^(m-1) for each middle interval\n    for i in range(1, len(intervals) - 1):\n        m = intervals[i]\n        if m > 0:\n            ans = ans * pow2[m - 1] % MOD\n\n    return ans\n```",
