      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\nimport bisect\n\ndef beautifulIndices(s: str, a: str, b: str, k: int) -> List[int]:\n    n = len(s)\n    la, lb = len(a), len(b)\n    \n    # Collect all starting indices where a appears in s\n    indices_a = [i for i in range(n - la + 1) if s[i:i+la] == a]\n    # Collect all starting indices where b appears in s\n    indices_b = [j for j in range(n - lb + 1) if s[j:j+lb] == b]\n    \n    beautiful = []\n    for i in indices_a:\n        # Find the smallest j in indices_b such that j >= i - k\n        idx = bisect.bisect_left(indices_b, i - k)\n        if idx < len(indices_b) and indices_b[idx] <= i + k:\n            beautiful.append(i)\n            \n    return beautiful\n```",
