    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    S = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n    T = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n    \n    from collections import Counter\n    cntS = Counter(S)\n    cntT = Counter(T)\n    \n    allowed = set('atcoder')\n    \n    for c in cntS:\n        if c == '@':\n            continue\n        if c not in allowed:\n            if cntS[c] != cntT.get(c, 0):\n                print(\"No\")\n                return\n    for c in cntT:\n        if c == '@':\n            continue\n        if c not in allowed:\n            if cntS.get(c, 0) != cntT[c]:\n                print(\"No\")\n                return\n                \n    D_S = 0\n    D_T = 0\n    for c in allowed:\n        s_cnt = cntS.get(c, 0)\n        t_cnt = cntT.get(c, 0)\n        if t_cnt > s_cnt:\n            D_S += t_cnt - s_cnt\n        elif s_cnt > t_cnt:\n            D_T += s_cnt - t_cnt\n            \n    at_s = cntS.get('@', 0)\n    at_t = cntT.get('@', 0)\n    \n    if D_S <= at_s and D_T <= at_t:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n```",
