      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\nMOD = 998244353\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    S = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n    N = len(S)\n    \n    # Precompute powers of 26\n    pow26 = [1] * (N + 1)\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        pow26[i] = (pow26[i - 1] * 26) % MOD\n    \n    # DP for suffix matching [A-Z]*[a-z]*\n    dp0 = [0] * (N + 1)\n    dp1 = [0] * (N + 1)\n    dp0[N] = 1\n    dp1[N] = 1\n    for i in range(N - 1, -1, -1):\n        c = S[i]\n        if c == '?':\n            dp0[i] = (26 * dp0[i + 1] + 26 * dp1[i + 1]) % MOD\n            dp1[i] = (26 * dp1[i + 1]) % MOD\n        elif 'A' <= c <= 'Z':\n            dp0[i] = dp0[i + 1]\n            dp1[i] = 0\n        else:  # lowercase\n            dp0[i] = dp1[i + 1]\n            dp1[i] = dp1[i + 1]\n    \n    # Modular inverses up to 26\n    inv = [0] * 27\n    for i in range(1, 27):\n        inv[i] = pow(i, MOD - 2, MOD)\n    \n    f = 0                # number of distinct fixed uppercase seen\n    m = 0                # number of '?' seen\n    fixed_dup = False    # whether a duplicate fixed uppercase appeared\n    fixed_seen = [False] * 26\n    total_ways = 1       # ways of prefix with distinct uppercase\n    sum_included = 0     # sum over prefix ways of (f + k)\n    ans = 0\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        c = S[i]\n        suffix_w = dp0[i + 1]   # ways for suffix after i\n        \n        if not fixed_dup:\n            if c == '?':\n                A = sum_included\n            elif 'a' <= c <= 'z':\n                A = 0\n            else:  # uppercase\n                idx = ord(c) - 65\n                if fixed_seen[idx]:\n                    A = total_ways\n                else:\n                    A = 0\n                    max_k = min(m, 26 - f)\n                    if max_k > 0:\n                        c_mk = m % MOD\n                        p2 = 1\n                        for k in range(1, max_k + 1):\n                            term = c_mk * k % MOD * p2 % MOD * pow26[m - k] % MOD\n                            A = (A + term) % MOD\n                            if k == max_k:\n                                break\n                            c_mk = c_mk * (m - k) % MOD * inv[k + 1] % MOD\n                            p2 = p2 * (26 - f - k) % MOD\n            ans = (ans + A * suffix_w) % MOD\n        \n        # Update prefix state with character c\n        if c == '?':\n            m += 1\n        elif 'a' <= c <= 'z':\n            pass\n        else:\n            idx = ord(c) - 65\n            if fixed_seen[idx]:\n                fixed_dup = True\n                total_ways = 0\n                sum_included = 0\n            else:\n                fixed_seen[idx] = True\n                f += 1\n        \n        # Recompute total_ways and sum_included for the new prefix\n        if not fixed_dup:\n            max_k = min(m, 26 - f)\n            if max_k == 0:\n                total_ways = pow26[m]\n                sum_included = (f * total_ways) % MOD\n            else:\n                total_ways = 0\n                sum_included = 0\n                c_mk = 1\n                p1 = 1\n                for k in range(max_k + 1):\n                    term = c_mk * p1 % MOD * pow26[m - k] % MOD\n                    total_ways = (total_ways + term) % MOD\n                    sum_included = (sum_included + (f + k) * term) % MOD\n                    if k == max_k:\n                        break\n                    c_mk = c_mk * (m - k) % MOD * inv[k + 1] % MOD\n                    p1 = p1 * (26 - f - k) % MOD\n    \n    # Strings without any duplicate uppercase\n    if not fixed_dup:\n        ans = (ans + total_ways) % MOD\n    \n    print(ans)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
