    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    D = int(next(it))\n    D2 = D * D\n    points = [(int(next(it)), int(next(it))) for _ in range(N)]\n\n    visited = [False] * N\n    visited[0] = True\n    q = [0]\n    head = 0\n\n    while head < len(q):\n        i = q[head]\n        head += 1\n        xi, yi = points[i]\n        for j in range(N):\n            if not visited[j]:\n                xj, yj = points[j]\n                dx = xi - xj\n                dy = yi - yj\n                if dx * dx + dy * dy <= D2:\n                    visited[j] = True\n                    q.append(j)\n\n    out = [\"Yes\" if v else \"No\" for v in visited]\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out))\n```",
