      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\nMOD = 998244353\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    N = int(data[0])\n    M = int(data[1])\n\n    a = M - 1\n    # (M-1)^N mod MOD\n    pow_val = pow(a, N, MOD)\n\n    # (-1)^N * (M-1) mod MOD\n    if N % 2 == 0:\n        term = a % MOD\n    else:\n        term = (-a) % MOD\n\n    ans = (pow_val + term) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
