      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport heapq\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    M = int(next(it))\n    P = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(N)]\n    L = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(M)]\n    D = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(M)]\n    \n    P.sort()\n    coupons = sorted(zip(L, D))\n    \n    total_price = sum(P)\n    total_discount = 0\n    \n    heap = []\n    coupon_idx = 0\n    \n    for price in P:\n        while coupon_idx < M and coupons[coupon_idx][0] <= price:\n            heapq.heappush(heap, -coupons[coupon_idx][1])\n            coupon_idx += 1\n        if heap:\n            total_discount += -heapq.heappop(heap)\n    \n    print(total_price - total_discount)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
