      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.readline\n\n    H, W, N = map(int, input().split())\n    holes_by_row = [[] for _ in range(H)]\n    for _ in range(N):\n        r, c = map(int, input().split())\n        holes_by_row[r - 1].append(c - 1)\n\n    dp_prev = [0] * W\n    dp_curr = [0] * W\n    ans = 0\n\n    for i in range(H):\n        # mark holes in the current row\n        mask = bytearray(W)\n        for c in holes_by_row[i]:\n            mask[c] = 1\n\n        for j in range(W):\n            if mask[j]:\n                dp_curr[j] = 0\n            else:\n                if i == 0 or j == 0:\n                    dp_curr[j] = 1\n                else:\n                    m = dp_prev[j]\n                    if dp_curr[j - 1] < m:\n                        m = dp_curr[j - 1]\n                    if dp_prev[j - 1] < m:\n                        m = dp_prev[j - 1]\n                    dp_curr[j] = m + 1\n            ans += dp_curr[j]\n\n        # swap rows for next iteration\n        dp_prev, dp_curr = dp_curr, dp_prev\n\n    print(ans)\n```",
