      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport bisect\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    M = int(next(it))\n    A = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(N)]\n    B = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(M)]\n    \n    A.sort()\n    B.sort()\n    \n    # Number of sellers who can sell at price x: count of A_i <= x\n    # Number of buyers who can buy at price x: count of B_i >= x\n    def check(x):\n        sellers = bisect.bisect_right(A, x)\n        buyers = M - bisect.bisect_left(B, x)\n        return sellers >= buyers\n    \n    low = 1\n    high = max(A[-1], B[-1]) + 1\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if check(mid):\n            high = mid\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    print(low)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
