      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    intervals = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        T = int(next(it))\n        D = int(next(it))\n        intervals.append((T, T + D))\n    intervals.sort(key=lambda x: x[1])\n    ans = 0\n    last_time = -10**19  # sufficiently small\n    for s, e in intervals:\n        next_time = last_time + 1\n        if next_time < s:\n            next_time = s\n        if next_time <= e:\n            ans += 1\n            last_time = next_time\n    print(ans)\n```",
