    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    A = int(next(it))\n    B = int(next(it))\n    C = int(next(it))\n    \n    D = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(N):\n            D[i][j] = int(next(it))\n    \n    INF = 10**18\n    \n    car_weight = [[D[i][j] * A for j in range(N)] for i in range(N)]\n    train_weight = [[D[i][j] * B + C for j in range(N)] for i in range(N)]\n    \n    def dijkstra(start: int, weight: list[list[int]]) -> list[int]:\n        dist = [INF] * N\n        visited = [False] * N\n        dist[start] = 0\n        \n        for _ in range(N):\n            u = -1\n            min_d = INF\n            for i in range(N):\n                if not visited[i] and dist[i] < min_d:\n                    min_d = dist[i]\n                    u = i\n            if u == -1:\n                break\n            visited[u] = True\n            w_u = weight[u]\n            for v in range(N):\n                if not visited[v]:\n                    nd = dist[u] + w_u[v]\n                    if nd < dist[v]:\n                        dist[v] = nd\n        return dist\n    \n    dist_car = dijkstra(0, car_weight)\n    dist_train = dijkstra(N - 1, train_weight)\n    \n    answer = min(dist_car[i] + dist_train[i] for i in range(N))\n    print(answer)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
