      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    from itertools import combinations\n\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    M = int(next(it))\n    K = int(next(it))\n\n    edges = []\n    for _ in range(M):\n        u = int(next(it)) - 1\n        v = int(next(it)) - 1\n        w = int(next(it))\n        edges.append((u, v, w))\n\n    min_cost = K\n    parent = list(range(N))\n\n    def find(x):\n        # path compression\n        while parent[x] != x:\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\n            x = parent[x]\n        return x\n\n    # enumerate all subsets of edges of size N-1\n    for comb in combinations(range(M), N - 1):\n        # reset Union-Find\n        for i in range(N):\n            parent[i] = i\n        cost = 0\n        cnt = N\n        valid = True\n        for idx in comb:\n            u, v, w = edges[idx]\n            cost += w\n            ru = find(u)\n            rv = find(v)\n            if ru != rv:\n                parent[ru] = rv\n                cnt -= 1\n            else:\n                valid = False\n                break\n        if valid and cnt == 1:\n            cost %= K\n            if cost < min_cost:\n                min_cost = cost\n\n    print(min_cost)\n```",
