      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    A, M, L, R = map(int, data)\n    # We need to count integer k such that L <= A + k * M <= R\n    # i.e., (L - A) <= k * M <= (R - A)\n    a = L - A\n    b = R - A\n    \n    # ceil division for possibly negative a and positive M\n    def ceil_div(x: int, y: int) -> int:\n        return -(-x // y)\n    \n    k_min = ceil_div(a, M)\n    k_max = b // M  # floor division\n    \n    ans = max(0, k_max - k_min + 1)\n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
