      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    N = int(data[0])\n    Q = int(data[1])\n    idx = 2\n    history = [(1, 0)]\n    out = []\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        t = data[idx]\n        if t == '1':\n            d = data[idx + 1]\n            idx += 2\n            hx, hy = history[-1]\n            if d == 'R':\n                hx += 1\n            elif d == 'L':\n                hx -= 1\n            elif d == 'U':\n                hy += 1\n            elif d == 'D':\n                hy -= 1\n            history.append((hx, hy))\n        else:\n            p = int(data[idx + 1])\n            idx += 2\n            if p <= len(history):\n                x, y = history[-p]\n            else:\n                m = len(history) - 1\n                x = p - m\n                y = 0\n            out.append(f\"{x} {y}\")\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out))\n```",
