      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.readline\n    N = int(input().strip())\n    size = 2 * N + 1\n    chord_at = [0] * size\n    is_L = [False] * size\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        a, b = map(int, input().split())\n        if a < b:\n            L, R = a, b\n        else:\n            L, R = b, a\n        chord_at[L] = i\n        is_L[L] = True\n        chord_at[R] = i\n        is_L[R] = False\n    stack = []\n    for x in range(1, size):\n        ch = chord_at[x]\n        if is_L[x]:\n            stack.append(ch)\n        else:\n            if not stack or stack[-1] != ch:\n                print(\"Yes\")\n                return\n            stack.pop()\n    print(\"No\")\n```",
