    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.readline\n    N, M = map(int, input().split())\n    INF = 10**18\n    \n    # distance matrix initialisation\n    dist = [[INF] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        dist[i][i] = 0\n        \n    for _ in range(M):\n        u, v, w = map(int, input().split())\n        u -= 1\n        v -= 1\n        if w < dist[u][v]:\n            dist[u][v] = w\n            \n    # Floyd-Warshall: all-pairs shortest paths\n    for k in range(N):\n        dk = dist[k]\n        for i in range(N):\n            di = dist[i]\n            dik = di[k]\n            if dik == INF:\n                continue\n            for j in range(N):\n                dkj = dk[j]\n                if dkj != INF:\n                    new = dik + dkj\n                    if new < di[j]:\n                        di[j] = new\n                        \n    # DP over subsets (bitmask) for minimum weight path visiting all vertices\n    size = 1 << N\n    dp = [[INF] * N for _ in range(size)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        dp[1 << i][i] = 0\n        \n    full_mask = size - 1\n    for mask in range(1, size):\n        for last in range(N):\n            cost = dp[mask][last]\n            if cost == INF:\n                continue\n            not_mask = full_mask ^ mask\n            nxt = not_mask\n            while nxt:\n                bit = nxt & -nxt\n                v = bit.bit_length() - 1\n                nxt ^= bit\n                if dist[last][v] == INF:\n                    continue\n                new_cost = cost + dist[last][v]\n                new_mask = mask | bit\n                if new_cost < dp[new_mask][v]:\n                    dp[new_mask][v] = new_cost\n                    \n    ans = min(dp[full_mask])\n    if ans >= INF:\n        print(\"No\")\n    else:\n        print(ans)\n```",
