    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef relocateMarbles(nums: List[int], moveFrom: List[int], moveTo: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the sorted list of occupied positions after performing all moves.\n    \n    :param nums: Initial positions of marbles.\n    :param moveFrom: List of source positions for each move.\n    :param moveTo: List of target positions for each move.\n    :return: Sorted list of occupied positions after all moves.\n    \"\"\"\n    occupied = set(nums)\n    \n    for f, t in zip(moveFrom, moveTo):\n        if f != t:\n            occupied.remove(f)\n            occupied.add(t)\n            \n    return sorted(occupied)\n```",
