      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_pairs(words):\n    index_map = {word: i for i, word in enumerate(words)}\n    used = [False] * len(words)\n    pairs = 0\n    for i, word in enumerate(words):\n        if used[i]:\n            continue\n        rev = word[::-1]\n        if rev != word and rev in index_map:\n            j = index_map[rev]\n            if not used[j]:\n                used[i] = True\n                used[j] = True\n                pairs += 1\n    return pairs\n```",
