      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    N = int(data[0])\n    K = int(data[1])\n    P = [int(x) for x in data[2:2 + N]]\n    \n    # pos[value] = index in permutation (0-based)\n    pos = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for idx, val in enumerate(P):\n        pos[val] = idx\n        \n    min_deq = deque()  # values increasing\n    max_deq = deque()  # values decreasing\n    ans = N\n    \n    for val in range(1, N + 1):\n        p = pos[val]\n        \n        # Maintain min deque\n        while min_deq and min_deq[-1] > p:\n            min_deq.pop()\n        min_deq.append(p)\n        \n        # Maintain max deque\n        while max_deq and max_deq[-1] < p:\n            max_deq.pop()\n        max_deq.append(p)\n        \n        # When window size reaches K\n        if val >= K:\n            diff = max_deq[0] - min_deq[0]\n            if diff < ans:\n                ans = diff\n                \n            # Remove element sliding out of the window\n            out = pos[val - K + 1]\n            if min_deq and min_deq[0] == out:\n                min_deq.popleft()\n            if max_deq and max_deq[0] == out:\n                max_deq.popleft()\n                \n    print(ans)\n```",
