      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minLength(words: List[str]) -> int:\n    # Initialize DP with the first word\n    w0 = words[0]\n    dp = {}\n    dp[(w0[0], w0[-1])] = len(w0)\n    \n    for w in words[1:]:\n        new_dp = {}\n        w_len = len(w)\n        w_first = w[0]\n        w_last = w[-1]\n        \n        for (first, last), length in dp.items():\n            # Option 1: append w to the right: join(S, w)\n            overlap_right = 1 if last == w_first else 0\n            len_right = length + w_len - overlap_right\n            key_right = (first, w_last)\n            if key_right not in new_dp or len_right < new_dp[key_right]:\n                new_dp[key_right] = len_right\n            \n            # Option 2: prepend w to the left: join(w, S)\n            overlap_left = 1 if w_last == first else 0\n            len_left = length + w_len - overlap_left\n            key_left = (w_first, last)\n            if key_left not in new_dp or len_left < new_dp[key_left]:\n                new_dp[key_left] = len_left\n                \n        dp = new_dp\n        \n    return min(dp.values())\n```",
