      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reads the input and prints the maximum absolute difference between\n    the total weights of any two trucks for each test case.\n    \"\"\"\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    t = int(next(it))\n    out_lines = []\n\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(next(it))\n        a = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(n)]\n\n        # prefix sums for O(1) sum queries\n        pref = [0] * (n + 1)\n        for i in range(n):\n            pref[i + 1] = pref[i] + a[i]\n\n        ans = 0\n        # Try all possible trucks capacities k that divide n\n        for k in range(1, n + 1):\n            if n % k == 0:\n                min_sum = float('inf')\n                max_sum = -float('inf')\n                # Each truck takes exactly k contiguous boxes\n                for i in range(0, n, k):\n                    s = pref[i + k] - pref[i]\n                    if s < min_sum:\n                        min_sum = s\n                    if s > max_sum:\n                        max_sum = s\n                diff = max_sum - min_sum\n                if diff > ans:\n                    ans = diff\n\n        out_lines.append(str(ans))\n\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out_lines))\n```",
