      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    t = int(next(it))\n    out = []\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(next(it))\n        a = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(n)]\n        # Kadane's algorithm with parity constraint\n        max_sum = a[0]\n        cur_sum = a[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            if (a[i] % 2) != (a[i-1] % 2):\n                cur_sum = max(a[i], cur_sum + a[i])\n            else:\n                cur_sum = a[i]\n            if cur_sum > max_sum:\n                max_sum = cur_sum\n        out.append(str(max_sum))\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
