      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef productMatrix(grid: List[List[int]]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    MOD = 12345\n    # Flatten the 2D grid into a 1D list\n    flat = [x for row in grid for x in row]\n    n = len(flat)\n    \n    # Compute prefix products modulo MOD\n    prefix = [1] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix[i+1] = (prefix[i] * (flat[i] % MOD)) % MOD\n        \n    # Compute suffix products modulo MOD\n    suffix = [1] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(n-1, -1, -1):\n        suffix[i] = (suffix[i+1] * (flat[i] % MOD)) % MOD\n        \n    # Result for flattened grid: prefix[i] * suffix[i+1] % MOD\n    res_flat = [(prefix[i] * suffix[i+1]) % MOD for i in range(n)]\n    \n    # Reshape back to original 2D structure\n    res = []\n    idx = 0\n    for row in grid:\n        m = len(row)\n        res.append(res_flat[idx:idx+m])\n        idx += m\n        \n    return res\n```",
