    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Explain what the term (7/10) EOM means.\n\nOptions: \nA. A customer may deduct 7% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made no later than the tenth day after the end of the month\nB. A customer may deduct 10% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made within 7 days of receiving the invoice\nC. A customer may deduct 7% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made on the tenth day of the month\nD. A customer must pay the full amount of the invoice within 7 days of the end of the month\nE. A customer may deduct 10% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made no later than the seventh day after the end of the month\nF. A customer may deduct 7% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made within 10 days of receiving the invoice\nG. A customer may deduct 10% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made on the 7th day after the end of the month\nH. A customer may deduct 7% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made on the 10th day of the month\nI. A customer must pay the full amount of the invoice within 10 days of the end of the month\nJ. A customer may deduct 10% of the amount of the invoice if payment is made no later than the seventh day of the month\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
