    "global index": "MMLUPro_business_616",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Enhancement of job satisfaction and productivity are key characteristics of which theoretical perspective of work design?\n\nOptions: \nA. Human Relations theory\nB. Process improvement\nC. Job enrichment theory\nD. Job enlargement theory\nE. Time and Motion study\nF. Techno-structural change model\nG. Scientific management theory\nH. Socio-technical systems\nI. Motivational theory\nJ. Job characteristics model\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
