    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The original monthly revenue was $350 × 1,000 = $350,000. The new monthly revenue is $320 × 1,080 = $345,600, so revenue decreased. Since unit production costs remained unchanged, total costs rose with the higher quantity, while revenue fell; therefore, profit also decreased.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
