    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A perfectly competitive employer hires labor up to the point where\n\nOptions: \nA. Wage = Total cost of production.\nB. Wage = Marginal product of labor.\nC. Wage = Marginal cost.\nD. Wage = Average product of labor.\nE. Wage = Average factor cost.\nF. Wage = Marginal revenue product of labor.\nG. Wage = Marginal factor cost.\nH. Wage = Marginal revenue.\nI. Wage = Average revenue.\nJ. Wage = Total revenue.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
