    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Find the Laplace transform of f(t) =t^n, where n is a positive integer,\n\nOptions: \nA. L{{t^n}} = [n^2 / (s^(n+2))], for s > 0\nB. L{{t^n}} = [n! / (s^(n-1))], for s > n\nC. L{{t^n}} = [n! / (s^(n+1)+1)], for s > 0\nD. L{{t^n}} = [(n-1)! / s^(n-1)], for s > 0\nE. L{{t^n}} = [(n+1)! / s^n], for s > 0\nF. L{{t^n}} = [(n+1)! / (s^(n+1))], for s > 0\nG. L{{t^n}} = [(n-1)! / (s^n+1)], for s > 0\nH. L{{t^n}} = [n! / (s^n-1)], for s > 0\nI. L{{t^n}} = [n! / (s^n+1)], for s > 0\nJ. L{{t^n}} = [n! / s^n], for s > 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
