    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Compute the conditional distribution of Y given X if X and Y are jointly distributed with density f(x, y) = x + y0 < x < 1, 0 < y < 1 and = 0otherwise. What is the conditional expectation of Y?\n\nOptions: \nA. (x + 2) / {{2(x + 1)}}\nB. (2x + 3) / {{2(3x + 1)}}\nC. (2x + 2) / {{4(2x + 1)}}\nD. (3x + 3) / {{3(3x + 2)}}\nE. (2x + 1) / {{3(x + 2)}}\nF. (x + 1) / {{2(2x + 1)}}\nG. (3x + 2) / {{3(2x + 1)}}\nH. (3x + 1) / {{3(2x + 2)}}\nI. (4x + 2) / {{4(3x + 1)}}\nJ. (3x + 2) / {{4(2x + 1)}}\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
