    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The forces experienced by a test charge q for three different velocities at a point in a region characterized by electric and magnetic fields are given by F_1= q[E_0i_x + (E_0 - v_0B_0)i_y]forv_1= v_0i_x F_2= q[(E_0 + v_0B_0)i_x + E_0i_y]forv_2= v_0i_y- F_3= q[E_0i_x + E_0i_y]forv_3= v_0i_z where v_0, E_0, and B_0 are constants. FindE and B at the point.\n\nOptions: \nA. E= E_0 (i_x +i_y), B= B_0i_z\nB. E= E_0(i_y - i_x), B= -B_0(i_y + i_z)\nC. E= E_0(i_x + 2i_y), B= B_0(i_y - i_z)\nD. E= -E_0 (i_x +i_y), B= B_0i_z\nE. E= 0, B= B_0(i_x + i_y + i_z)\nF. E= E_0 (i_x +i_y), B= -B_0i_z\nG. E= E_0 (i_x - i_y), B= B_0i_z\nH. E= E_0i_x, B= B_0(i_x + i_y)\nI. E= 2E_0(i_x + i_y), B= 0.5B_0i_z\nJ. E= -E_0i_y, B= B_0(i_x - i_z)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
