      "generated_answer": "The speech criticizes nativist immigration policies and explicitly references racial discrimination against specific ethnic groups. The Chinese Exclusion Act of 1882 was the first major law to ban immigration based on nationality and race, making it a quintessential example of nativism in legislation.\n\n\\boxed{F}",
