      "generated_answer": "The question focuses on Latin American politics in the **twentieth century**.  \nOf the options, **Theodore Roosevelt** (with his “Roosevelt Corollary” to the Monroe Doctrine) was heavily involved in Latin America, particularly in the early 1900s.  \n\n\\boxed{A}",
