      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is H, as primary context refers specifically to artifacts found undisturbed in their original place of deposition, which perfectly matches the description of a cache or collection discovered where it was left. Other options describe secondary contexts (movement, exposure, or modern relocation) or ambiguous scenarios that do not clearly guarantee the undisturbed, original location required for a primary context.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
