    "global index": "MMLUPro_history_4620",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is NOT an innovation of the Mesolithic?\n\nOptions: \nA. crop irrigation systems\nB. the creation of fishing nets\nC. European use of bow and arrow\nD. domestication of animals\nE. canoes\nF. the development of flint tools\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
