      "generated_answer": "The Mesolithic period featured innovations like fishing nets, the bow and arrow, canoes, early animal domestication (such as dogs), and advanced flint microliths. Crop irrigation systems, however, are a hallmark of the Neolithic agricultural revolution, not the Mesolithic.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
