    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is not a hypothesis for why hominids walked on two legs?\n\nOptions: \nA. it expended less energy than quadrupedalism for going long distances\nB. it freed the hands to carry things\nC. it allowed hominids to see greater distances\nD. it provided a more intimidating posture to potential predators\nE. it allowed for better heat regulation\nF. it allowed for braincase expansion\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
