      "generated_answer": "The verse commands believers to abstain from specific vices by framing them as Satan's handiwork and promising success through avoidance, which functions as a strict behavioral directive. Among the options, this aligns most closely with a puritanical injunction enforcing a moral code rather than a tale, philosophical discourse, or call for tolerance.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
      "success": true,
