      "generated_answer": "The questioning of ancient philosophers through experimentation directly challenged the authority of classical texts, which was a core tenet of Classicism. Classicism emphasized the study and imitation of ancient Greek and Roman works as supreme authorities, making it inherently in conflict with Galileo's empirical refutations of Aristotle.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
