    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The text is an excerpt from Martin Luther's *Address to the Christian Nobility of the German Nation*, which attacks papal authority and church corruption. Among the options, Philipp Melanchthon was Luther's closest colleague and a fellow leader of the Lutheran Reformation, sharing these exact criticisms and theological positions.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
      "success": true,
