      "generated_answer": "Derek Parfit is best known for arguing against egalitarianism—the view that equality itself is intrinsically valuable—and instead advocating for the \"Priority View,\" which holds that benefiting the worse off matters more, regardless of whether inequality is reduced. Because he rejects equality as a fundamental moral ideal, Option B most closely captures his position.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
      "success": true,
